# 🔄 5. UPDATE RELATIONSHIP

The primary update relationship is:

```text
GAME STATE SYSTEM
        │
        │ STATE CHANGE
        ▼
DATABASE SYSTEM
        │
        │ SAVE
        ▼
DATABASE
```

The reverse process occurs when the game starts:

```text
DATABASE
    │
    │ LOAD
    ▼
DATABASE SYSTEM
    │
    ▼
GAME STATE SYSTEM
    │
    ▼
GAME WORLD
```

Therefore:

```text
GAME STATE → DATABASE
```

and:

```text
DATABASE → GAME STATE
```

