When the Master reaches Floor 100 and defeats Nythar, the Database contains the history necessary to construct the new Aetheria.

The system can read:

```text
Saved Characters
Surviving Factions
Destroyed Locations
Completed Quests
Relationships
Master Decisions
Story Flags
World Conditions
Faction Conditions
