# ✨ 44. FINAL PRINCIPLE

Aetheria follows this fundamental rule:

```text
CORE WORLD BUILDING
        ↓
Defines the world
        ↓
GAME MANAGER
        ↓
Coordinates systems
        ↓
GAME STATE SYSTEM
        ↓
Determines current state
        ↓
DATABASE SYSTEM
        ↓
Stores current state
        ↓
PERSISTENT WORLD MEMORY
```

Or simply:

> **Core World Building defines Aetheria.**

> **Game Manager coordinates Aetheria.**

> **Game State System changes Aetheria.**

> **Database System remembers Aetheria.**

The Database System therefore becomes the **persistent memory layer** of the entire game.

Without the Database System, the world can change.

With the Database System, **the world can remember that it changed.**
